DoTwo Teleprompter
Copyright 2026 Domingo Moreno / DoTwo

Original concept and project direction: Domingo Moreno / DoTwo.

This project was created to provide a practical desktop teleprompter
workflow for audiovisual production, with separate control and prompter
windows, local operation, and operator-oriented controls.

Initial implementation and tooling were developed with OpenClaw/Bender
assistance.

This product includes third-party open source software. See
THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for dependency notices.
